WEBVTT

00:00:03.178 --> 00:00:07.967
Open Artificial Intelligence, Model Context Protocol, MCP Hosts.

00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:11.388
The connections of the site are listed here.

00:00:11.841 --> 00:00:13.401
Click Add Connection.

00:00:13.401 --> 00:00:16.693
The window lists the kinds of server you can reach.

00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:20.621
Click Add on Server-Sent Events, which is a server on the web.

00:00:21.072 --> 00:00:26.642
Give the connection a Title, and enter the Endpoint, which is the address of the server.

00:00:27.092 --> 00:00:30.845
Under Authentication, choose how the site signs in.

00:00:30.845 --> 00:00:33.281
Anonymous suits an open server.

00:00:33.281 --> 00:00:35.782
This server asks for an API key.

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:41.033
You can set the Header Name and a Key Prefix, then paste the API key.

00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:44.295
It is stored securely, and never shown again.

00:00:44.747 --> 00:00:45.705
Click Save.

00:00:45.705 --> 00:00:49.592
The site does not contact the server yet, so a wrong address or

00:00:49.592 --> 00:00:53.367
key shows up the first time an assistant uses the connection.

